# Title photography — held out pending a provenance answer, NOT a known
# license restriction. The files carry no rights metadata at all (verified:
# EXIF-only APP1, empty IPTC stub, no XMP), so we cannot tell from them
# whether Digi owns these or licensed them. This repo is public and git
# history is effectively permanent, so the cautious default is to wait for
# an answer from Digi marketing rather than publish and find out.
# See assets/photos/README.md (tracked) for status and how to populate.
assets/photos/*.jpeg
assets/photos/*.jpg
assets/photos/*.png
